It is evening.
Now I get down from the bus.
I walk towards home.
There is a small shop on the way.
Now I stop there.
A shopkeeper sits there.
I say to him, "Bhaiya, hello."
He says, "Hello."
"What is needed?"
I ask, "Is there fresh milk here?"
"Yes, there is," the shopkeeper says.
"Please give me milk," I say.
"Is there bread too?" I ask.
"Yes, bread is here too," he says.
He gives me the milk and bread.
"How much is the price?" I ask.
"Fifty rupees," bhaiya says.
I give him fifty rupees.
I put the milk and bread in my bag.
Now my bag is full.
Now I go home quickly.
